      "description": "Independence Day Celebrations & US Semiquincentennial",
      "details": "Independence Day is a major federal holiday in the U.S., typically involving extensive celebrations, travel, and outdoor activities. In 2026, it marked America's 250th birthday (Semiquincentennial), leading to amplified national events and festivities. This widespread engagement in offline activities and patriotic content dominating social feeds would significantly divert consumer attention from online shopping, leading to decreased ad effectiveness, lower ROAS, and higher CPA.",
